{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\ud83d\udda4 About the Game</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">RIP Love: A Story of Pain</span></strong> is a narrative-driven experience where players don\u2019t choose their own path, but instead live through a carefully written story full of emotions, heartbreak, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional branching games, this title offers a single, immersive storyline that unfolds step by step, allowing the player to fully feel the intended atmosphere without distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative: No branching choices \u2013 one carefully crafted story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive experience: Focus on atmosphere, visuals, and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style: Progress through scenes that reflect the emotional journey of the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\ud83c\udf0d Supported Languages</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully localized into 12 languages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 (Arabic)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fran\u00e7ais (French)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 (Korean)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deutsch (German)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 (Hindi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648 (Urdu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 (Russian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T\u00fcrk\u00e7e (Turkish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portugu\u00eas (Portuguese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Espa\u00f1ol (Spanish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\u2728 Key Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique storytelling experience with no gameplay distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed visuals and soundtracks to support the emotional tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible worldwide with 12 fully supported languages.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957640?t=1758576653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957640?t=1758576653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957640/be63425daa80fc89a1d58cf7e82a96e80a2c04a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758576653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957640/be63425daa80fc89a1d58cf7e82a96e80a2c04a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758576653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of sadness, grief, and emotional pain. Some scenes may be distressing for players who are sensitive to topics of loss, separation, or psychological struggle. There is no graphic violence, nudity, or sexual content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\ud83d\udda4 About the Game</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">RIP Love: A Story of Pain</span></strong> is a narrative-driven experience where players don\u2019t choose their own path, but instead live through a carefully written story full of emotions, heartbreak, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional branching games, this title offers a single, immersive storyline that unfolds step by step, allowing the player to fully feel the intended atmosphere without distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative: No branching choices \u2013 one carefully crafted story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive experience: Focus on atmosphere, visuals, and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style: Progress through scenes that reflect the emotional journey of the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\ud83c\udf0d Supported Languages</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully localized into 12 languages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 (Arabic)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fran\u00e7ais (French)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 (Korean)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deutsch (German)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 (Hindi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648 (Urdu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 (Russian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T\u00fcrk\u00e7e (Turkish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portugu\u00eas (Portuguese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Espa\u00f1ol (Spanish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\u2728 Key Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique storytelling experience with no gameplay distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed visuals and soundtracks to support the emotional tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible worldwide with 12 fully supported languages.</p>","developers":["Holeloop Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957640/2ca12a80772e16c6bc490489eff8d62dd19d0563/header.jpg?t=1758576653","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Holeloop Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minim